Package: fcexpr
Title: Complement the manual analysis of flow cytometric experiments and organize your fcs files in a consistent way
Version: 0.3.3
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Christopher Mark",
           family = "Skopnik",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "vonskopnik@pm.me",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6089-4769"))
Description: After manually gating populations from a cohort of fcs files a big pile of numbers needs to be analyzed statistiscally which usually requires to get those numbers out of flowjo. Such task and a few other things can be done with fcexpr. 
